Package: netspeed
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-ayatana-appindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-xapp-1.0
Maintainer: Atik Rony <https://github.com/atikrony>
Homepage: https://github.com/atikrony
Description: NetSpeed — Lightweight real-time network speed panel indicator
 A clean system panel indicator that displays real-time upload and
 download speeds stacked vertically in the panel.
 .
 Features:
  - Real-time upload and download speeds stacked (U: / D:)
  - Instantaneous network throughput without lagging
  - Multi-unit selector (Mbps, MB/s, Kbps, KB/s, Gbps, GB/s, etc.)
  - Customizable font family and font size selector
  - Custom color pickers for upload and download fonts
  - Daily data usage and monthly history tracking
  - Hover tooltip displaying today's total data usage
  - Compatible with Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint (Cinnamon), and derivatives
